WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.480
Do you want Chicago police not to help ICE agents?

00:03.760 --> 00:09.760
Our police department will respond to every incident in which their services are needed to

00:09.760 --> 00:14.880
keep people safe. Protecting the fundamental right to be able to protest, ensuring the maximal

00:14.880 --> 00:22.360
safety of our residents. Johnson's signaling that the police's priority is protecting protesters

00:22.360 --> 00:29.440
above everyone else. Agents are getting attacked with cars, projectiles, and being shot at across

00:29.440 --> 00:33.360
the country. But Governor Ribbs is declaring war on ICE.

